# --- game files and everything extracted from them: never commit ------------
# out/ holds the copy of the game, decompiled code, audio (FSB/WAV), texts in
# all languages, textures and the tables built from them (~25 GB).
# It belongs to Unknown Worlds and is rebuilt locally from your own copy.
out/
*.bank
*.fsb
*.wav
*.assets
*.bundle
*.resS

# --- private part: kept in a separate private repository --------------------
# translation/ links to ../Ukrainify-Private/subnautica-below-zero
# (tools, notes, Ukrainian texts, glossary, casting, redrawn art). The tools
# move here once they are ready to be published.
/translation

# --- third-party tools and the Python venv -----------------------------------
tools/

# --- tooling -----------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
*.iml
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

